Number: 207
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[C]It may be at morn, [F]when [C]the day is a[G]waking,
[G]When [C]sunlight [G7]through [Am7]darkness and [D7]shadow is [G]breaking,
[G7]That [C]Je[F]sus [G7]will [C]come in the [G7]fullness of [C]glory
